  "content": "\n\n<div>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1461931/description_7264b0a4-6da7-4d7b-acee-2b39a29eb3d1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"4000\" height=\"301\"></p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>传奇的<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/rlcraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">RLCraft</a></span>模组包，一个将载入模组包史册的名字，以粉丝自制版本回归。包含极端的生存挑战与无尽的怪物，这款硬核体验将把你推向极限。</strong></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<hr>\n<h1><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">&lt; 关键特性 &gt;</span></strong></h1>\n<h3><strong>- <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">冷热系统 &nbsp;</span></strong><br><strong>- 逼真的自然环境 &nbsp;</strong><br><strong>- 口渴机制 &nbsp;</strong><br><strong>- 逼真火把与动态光照 &nbsp;</strong><br><strong>- 禁用坐标与随机出生点 &nbsp;</strong><br><strong>- <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">使用经验解锁物品 &nbsp;</span></strong><br><strong>- 更强大的原版生物 &nbsp;</strong><br><strong>- 新遗迹与无尽强化 &nbsp;</strong><br><strong>- 逼真音效 &nbsp;</strong><br><strong>- <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">无尽地下城与随机词缀 &nbsp;</span></strong><br><strong>- 战斗塔回归 &nbsp;</strong><br><strong>- 全新组合与灾变级变化的Boss &nbsp;</strong><br><strong>- 流畅区块加载 &nbsp;</strong><br><strong>- 新战斗武器与光球 &nbsp;</strong><br><strong>- 逼真的玩家移动 &nbsp;</strong><br><strong>- <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">锁住的宝箱与开锁机制 &nbsp;</span></strong></h3>\n<strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></strong></div>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1461931/description_03ae41e4-70a0-4f98-8f75-93fdb28eb487.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"446\"></span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1461931/description_96840ea0-9dbc-4c54-aa1e-38270f79255d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"771\" height=\"246\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1461931/description_cf06a7f5-6c21-4769-af27-17a4199f6f92.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"575\" height=\"766\"></span></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#169179\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1461931/description_1d44e753-3cc4-44a2-9267-8f6b6bc5b31c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"5000\" height=\"3376\"></strong></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#169179\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1461931/description_d851e12d-bb10-40b7-9b43-3fd28d2c7760.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"5000\" height=\"2733\"></strong></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#169179\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1461931/description_291eae5c-3578-4846-9a46-ab360911443a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"5000\" height=\"1667\"></strong></span></h1>\n</div>\n<div><hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reforgedplay-mod/files/all\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1461931/description_e40cb1d6-dba3-4dda-9c58-d97310505df7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"5000\" height=\"1667\"></a>&nbsp;</h1>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#169179\"><strong>原始结构</strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/atomicstrykers-battle-towers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">AtomicStryker的战斗塔</span></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/recurrent-complex\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Recurrent Complex</span></strong></a></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">&lt; 提供帮助的人们 &gt;</span></strong></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/kimohpang/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">KIMOHPANG</span></a></strong></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shivaxi/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Shivaxi</span></a></strong></h1>\n<div>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/star_artsy/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">star_artsy</a></strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/emerythemodder/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EmeryTheModder</a></strong></span></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">感谢 Shivaxi 允许我制作这个粉丝自制版！</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><hr></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
